@startuml
[*] --> Initiated

Initiated --> FundsHeld : checks pass and funds enough
Initiated --> Rejected : check fails or funds not enough

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : request sent

SentToBiller --> Completed : biller confirms
SentToBiller --> Failed : biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : no answer in 10 s

Unknown --> Completed : biller later confirms
Unknown --> Failed : biller later refuses or reconciliation finds no payment

Failed --> Refunded : hold released

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]
@enduml
